OL,3,GNEWSATeen who fell from Benidorm
OL,4,Abalcony opens eyes after two weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who fell from a sixth-floor
OL,7,Fhotel balcony in Spain has opened his
OL,8,Feyes and responded to his relatives
OL,9,Fafter spending nearly two weeks in
OL,10,Fintensive care, his family has said.
OL,12,FJamie, 17, was seriously injured in
OL,13,FBenidorm on 10 November and has had two
OL,14,Femergency operations.
OL,16,FHis family, from Bury in Greater
OL,17,FManchester, said doctors had been
OL,18,Freducing Jamie's sedation and went on
OL,19,Fto say that he had responded to their
OL,20,Fvoices and had followed instructions.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
