OL,3,GNEWSATeen who fell from Benidorm
OL,4,Abalcony opens eyes after two weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the teenager's lungs are
OL,7,Fimproving, he remains seriously ill,
OL,8,Fstill requires support from a
OL,9,Fventilator and faces further surgery,
OL,10,Fthey said.
